# Eco-Warrior (Windurst) with its era module (modules/era/lua/quests/windurst/eco_warrior.lua; RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_ROV 0): the module's 62 at option 2 (its copy restricts on 1 only: nothing), then 1 (Level Restriction 20,
# subPower 1: "exp uses actual level"). A level-30 WAR then kills a Ghoul of the zone (level 22-26, id 17588618): the
# exp is graded on level 30; on the restricted 20 it would be more. Five ticks after the login first:
# zoneutils::AfterZoneIn (4 s after it) lifts a level restriction outside a battlefield. Perfect Dodge by GM keeps the
# char alive.
module modules/era/lua/quests/windurst/eco_warrior.lua
lists MazeOfShakhrami/Ahko_Mhalijikhari/onTrigger MazeOfShakhrami/onEventFinish/62
char zone=MazeOfShakhrami pos=-342.6,-11.2,-166.2 job=WAR lvl=30
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
quest Windurst.EcoWarrior accepted
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000                            # afterZoneIn
tick 1000
effect 49                            # a GM: Perfect Dodge
trigger Ahko_Mhalijikhari            # 62
finish option=2                      # the module's 62, not 1: nothing
trigger Ahko_Mhalijikhari            # 62 again
finish option=1                      # the module's 62: Level Restriction 20, subPower 1 (ON_ZONE)
kill #17588618                       # a Ghoul: exp graded on level 30
